    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Grab, drop, and score in the ultimate claw machine showdown! BattleClaws is a fast-paced, arcade-style party game for 2\u20134 players. Take control of a claw, snatch the right prizes, and outscore your friends in chaotic, rivalry inducing gameplay.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Couch Chaos: Up to 4 players battle it out locally in quick, competitive matches.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Quick Fire objectives: The target item changes mid-round, so move quick!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Clawsmetics:\u00a0 Customize your claw with hats, faces, and arcade-inspired accessories.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tiebreaker Mode: Sudden death overtime where only the fastest claw survives.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Important Note:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >BattleClaws is designed for local multiplayer action, meaning you'll need an additional controller to join the fray.  Early Access Build supports one player using keyboard WASD to move and SPACE to grab/drop. Grab a friend and an extra controller to dive into the chaotic fun and experience the thrill of claw machine battles together. Whether you're facing off in Battle Mode or creating your own tournaments in Custom Mode, the more players, the merrier the mayhem!</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Grab, drop, and score in the ultimate claw machine showdown! BattleClaws is a fast-paced, arcade-style party game for 2\u20134 players. Take control of a claw, snatch the right prizes, and outscore your friends in chaotic, rivalry inducing gameplay.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Couch Chaos: Up to 4 players battle it out locally in quick, competitive matches.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Quick Fire objectives: The target item changes mid-round, so move quick!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Clawsmetics:\u00a0 Customize your claw with hats, faces, and arcade-inspired accessories.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tiebreaker Mode: Sudden death overtime where only the fastest claw survives.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Important Note:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >BattleClaws is designed for local multiplayer action, meaning you'll need an additional controller to join the fray.  Early Access Build supports one player using keyboard WASD to move and SPACE to grab/drop. Grab a friend and an extra controller to dive into the chaotic fun and experience the thrill of claw machine battles together. Whether you're facing off in Battle Mode or creating your own tournaments in Custom Mode, the more players, the merrier the mayhem!</p>",
    "short_description": "Experience the ultimate local multiplayer claw 'em up! Battle for glory in this fast-paced arcade elimination game. Collect prizes for points, outlast your rivals, and be the last claw standing. Dominate the leaderboard and prove you\u2019re the ultimate BattleClaws champion!",
